reviews.review:
So far, I like it a lot. It´s the perfect game to play at the end of the day. It´s linear (well, your character can´t even jump), straightforward. No hidden keys, no back-and-forth grinding.
If you like:
- 3rd person shooter;
- Space environment with a taste of classic;
- very clear roles, good guys vs bad guys;
- great graphics;
- great sound effects;
- relatable (yet shallow) storyline.
Take away the magic, it´s The Lord of The Rings in space (warfare-wise, a few humans against an overwhelming horde of orcs) 
I highly recommend it. It´s pure entertainment, ferocious battles in sci-fi yet elegant style.

The only downside so far is the system to get health, which makes the games very hard all of a sudden.
